{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53608","headline":"石牀石监 · 李合","name":"石牀石监","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"麓牀高接天，伏虎上栖烟。\n松低轻盖偃，藤细若钩悬。\n石明如挂镜，照物别媸妍。\n鹤鸾时弄影，何处觅神仙。\n（见嘉庆十一年曾珏纂《宁远县志》卷九）（按：《沅湘耆旧集》卷三以此诗爲二首，前四句题作《麓牀》，後四句题作《石监》。\n今详诗意，似作一首爲是。\n又此诗与《全唐诗》卷七七骆宾王《出石门》甚相似，疑即据骆诗僞托。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53608.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53608","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}